Subject: [PATCH] BookSync: explicit-only Full refresh feedback

Keep intermediate notices silent and use the persisted user request as the progress gate.
Implementation: orbify/Mirror and orbify/RefreshBadge.

--- a/lib/I18n/translations/english.yaml
